flowchart TB
    User[Analyst / Administrator] --> Web[Next.js UI]
    Web --> Api[Open Notebook FastAPI]
    Api --> Graph[LangGraph Research Agent]
    Graph --> Esperanto[Upstream Esperanto Provider Registry]
    Esperanto --> Lite[LiteLLM Proxy]
    Lite --> Provider[OpenAI-compatible LLM Endpoint]
    Lite --> Pg[(PostgreSQL: usage + spend)]
    Graph --> Policy[SQL Review, Approval, MCP Policy]
    Policy --> Registry[MCP Client Registry]
    Registry --> DBHub[DBHub]
    Registry --> Toolbox[Google MCP Toolbox]
    Registry --> DuckMCP[DuckDB MCP Read-only]
    DBHub --> Enterprise[(SQL Server / PostgreSQL / MySQL / MariaDB / SQLite / Oracle)]
    Toolbox --> Extra[(Curated cloud / analytics DBs)]
    DuckMCP --> Duck[(Versioned local DuckDB)]
    Api --> Explorer[Open Data Explorer]
    Explorer --> Catalog[Data.gov v4 API]
    Explorer --> Jobs[Existing Open Notebook Worker]
    Jobs --> Pub[Approved publisher download / Census / NOAA adapters]
    Pub --> Duck
    Api --> Surreal[(SurrealDB: notebooks, source metadata, evidence)]
    Graph --> Surreal
